message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "HACS — Harder Arithmetic Cohomology System"
abstract: >-
  Simplicial orbifold cohomology of SL(2,Z) and GL(2) with coefficients in symmetric powers of the standard
  representation over F_p, Z/l^k and Z, with Hecke operators, Hecke extensions, Hida theory and the integral line.
  Code LGPL-3.0-only with the NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit exception; lean/ Apache-2.0; docs/ CC-BY-4.0 (COPYRIGHT.md).
type: software
authors:
